Keep @github/copilot in the built-in copilot extension, minus its natives.

This build compiles the Copilot extension from source and packages it with
packageCopilotExtensionStream, which runs the extension's production
dependencies through build/.moduleignore. Since 1.139 that file strips
'@github/copilot/**' outright, on the grounds that the agent host now uses the
runtime bundled with @github/copilot-sdk. Microsoft's pipeline never meets the
consequence, because it downloads the extension as a VSIX. A build from source
loses the extension's whole @github/copilot package instead: sdk/index.js,
package.json and LICENSE.md included.

Three things need that package:

  * The extension bundle keeps '@github/copilot' external and resolves "./sdk"
    through the exports map its postinstall writes ("./sdk" -> "./sdk/index.js").
    That is the version-matched SDK entry the copilotcli session provider loads,
    and without it the provider dies with "Cannot find module
    .../@github/copilot/sdk/index.js" on device.
  * The packaging tail's prepareBuiltInCopilotRipgrepShim throws "Copilot SDK
    directory not found" when sdk/ is missing, and build-vscode-oss.sh stops
    one stage earlier on its own guard for the same directory.
  * LICENSE.md is the GitHub Copilot CLI License, which has to travel with the
    redistributed copy. verify-server-tree.py requires it.

So the hunk replaces the blanket rule with the per-directory list 1.138 had,
minus that list's first line, which stripped sdk/index.js. The native and
optional payload directories are still stripped: prebuilds, clipboard,
ripgrep, pvrecorder, foundry-local-sdk, mxc-bin, sharp and keytar.node. The
target's natives come back after this filter as before, when
prepareBuiltInCopilotRipgrepShim materializes them into sdk/prebuilds from the
version-matched platform package.

The SDK entry is plain JavaScript (its native-addon lookups key off os.type(),
which reports "Linux" on Android, and are lazy per addon), so keeping it costs
about 2.6 MB and unlocks the whole session path.

--- a/build/.moduleignore
+++ b/build/.moduleignore
@@ -223,7 +223,14 @@
 
 # @github/copilot - strip unneeded binaries and files
 # Agent Host uses the runtime bundled with @github/copilot-sdk.
-@github/copilot/**
+@github/copilot/prebuilds/**
+@github/copilot/clipboard/**
+@github/copilot/ripgrep/**
+@github/copilot/pvrecorder/**
+@github/copilot/foundry-local-sdk/**
+@github/copilot/mxc-bin/**
+@github/copilot/sharp/**
+@github/copilot/**/keytar.node
 
 # Standalone Copilot CLI platform packages are not product dependencies.
 @github/copilot-darwin-arm64/**
